<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1920746659"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1614556890"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="dust"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="SennaRin"/><amll:meta key="album" value="dust"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:40.603"><div begin="00:13.055" end="03:40.743"><p begin="00:13.055" end="00:18.656" itunes:key="L1">Don't you see yourself in a kind of fairy tale?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不觉得你仿佛活在童话里吗</span></p><p begin="00:19.368" end="00:25.875" itunes:key="L16">差し出された掌の上で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那朝我伸出的掌心之上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa shi da sa re ta te no hi ra no u e de</span></p><p begin="00:25.904" end="00:32.241" itunes:key="L2">踊らされてく未来は 永久(とわ)の夢をみて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那任人操纵摆布的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o do ra sa re te ku mi ra i wa</span></p><p begin="00:32.628" end="00:38.926" itunes:key="L17">吐き出された言葉の裏を知る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">探知着话语背后的真意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ki da sa re ta ko to ba no u ra wo shi ru</span></p><p begin="00:39.679" end="00:50.017" itunes:key="L3">無秩序な綻びが 錆びついた景色を剥ぐ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而那些无序的破绽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu chi tsu jo na ho ko ro bi ga</span></p><p begin="00:50.975" end="00:54.370" itunes:key="L4">Left in the dust under the airy sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">留在无边际的天空下的尘埃之中</span></p><p begin="00:54.443" end="00:57.487" itunes:key="L18">刻まれていく鼓動<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一点一点铭刻着脉搏的跳动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki za ma re te i ku ko do u</span></p><p begin="00:57.497" end="01:04.079" itunes:key="L19">砕けて散った祈りは人知れず瞬(またた)く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经支离破碎的祈祷 仍在暗地里闪烁着微光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku da ke te chi 't ta i no ri wa hi to shi re zu ma ta ta ku</span></p><p begin="01:04.180" end="01:07.299" itunes:key="L20">Left in the dust under the open sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">留在广阔天空下的尘埃之中</span></p><p begin="01:07.392" end="01:10.292" itunes:key="L5">Life is a flash blinding bright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人生如一闪而过的璀璨之光</span></p><p begin="01:10.317" end="01:17.399" itunes:key="L21">ルールをなぞっても見出せない答え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便沿着规则探寻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ru u ru wo na zo 't te mo</span></p><p begin="01:17.580" end="01:31.472" itunes:key="L6">Oh Oh Oh Oh</p><p begin="01:43.875" end="01:49.609" itunes:key="L7">I don't see your face on the ordinary trail<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在寻常小路上 我看不见你的身影</span></p><p begin="01:50.155" end="01:56.413" itunes:key="L22">煙に巻いた境界線の先<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">境界线的前方已经卷入烟雾之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke mu ri ni ma i ta kyo u ka i se n no sa ki</span></p><p begin="01:56.698" end="02:03.020" itunes:key="L8">比べたがる思惑に 囚われた刹那<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被执着于输赢的想法囚困的一刹那</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ra be ta ga ru shi wa ku ni to ra wa re ta se tsu na</span></p><p begin="02:03.204" end="02:09.484" itunes:key="L23">空っぽなくせに強く縛る鳥籠<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">空无一物的鸟笼仍牢牢将我困缚在原地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ra 'p po na ku se ni tsu yo ku shi ba ru to ri ka go</span></p><p begin="02:10.458" end="02:20.708" itunes:key="L9">取り残された思いは 宇宙(そら)に踊る蜉蝣<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最终残留而下的思念</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ri no ko sa re ta o mo i wa</span></p><p begin="02:21.941" end="02:25.196" itunes:key="L24">Left in the dust under the airy sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">留在无边际的天空下的尘埃之中</span></p><p begin="02:25.262" end="02:28.269" itunes:key="L10">呼応しあっていく衝動<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彼此相互呼应的冲动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko o u shi a 't te i ku sho u do u</span></p><p begin="02:28.315" end="02:34.923" itunes:key="L11">頑な過ぎる心が いたずらな傷を増やす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这颗过分固执的心灵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ta ku na su gi ru ko ko ro ga</span></p><p begin="02:34.969" end="02:38.117" itunes:key="L25">Left in the dust under the open sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">留在广阔天空下的尘埃之中</span></p><p begin="02:38.195" end="02:41.141" itunes:key="L26">Life is a flash blinding bright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人生如一闪而过的璀璨之光</span></p><p begin="02:41.151" end="02:47.892" itunes:key="L27">狂ってくリズムを誰に預けよう？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这正在逐渐失控的旋律又能寄托给谁呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ru 't te ku ri zu mu wo da re ni a zu ke yo u ?</span></p><p begin="02:47.906" end="02:51.003" itunes:key="L12">Left in the dust under the airy sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">留在无边际的天空下的尘埃之中</span></p><p begin="02:51.181" end="02:54.255" itunes:key="L13">No, I'm not such a perfect doll<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我绝不会是任人肆意摆布的傀儡</span></p><p begin="02:54.325" end="03:00.795" itunes:key="L28">砕けて散った祈りは人知れず瞬(またた)く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经支离破碎的祈祷 仍在暗地里闪烁着微光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku da ke te chi 't ta i no ri wa hi to shi re zu ma ta ta ku</span></p><p begin="03:00.946" end="03:03.952" itunes:key="L29">Left in the dust under the open sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">留在广阔天空下的尘埃之中</span></p><p begin="03:04.006" end="03:06.996" itunes:key="L14">Life is a flash blinding bright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人生如一闪而过的璀璨之光</span></p><p begin="03:07.009" end="03:14.158" itunes:key="L30">ルールをなぞっても見出せない答え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便沿着规则探寻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ru u ru wo na zo 't te mo</span></p><p begin="03:14.387" end="03:27.135" itunes:key="L15">Oh Oh Oh Oh</p><p begin="03:27.318" end="03:40.743" itunes:key="L2581">Oh Oh Oh Oh</p></div></body></tt>